When performing a UNION operation on many tables with similar prefix, you can use a wildcard table to simplify your query. e.g., SELECT col1, col2 FROM `project_id.dataset_id.table_prefix*` WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX IN ('table1_suffix', 'table2_suffix');. Avoid manually listing tables unless absolutely necessary.
